                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 22160.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister King to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-11-01"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 1,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister King says he has been asked by British court to act as executor in will
                    of deceased British subject and asks instructions.</p>
            </div>
